msgctxt "100"
msgid "Kiryu-san!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr "Che è successo?"

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Help me, please...! She's gone, and I'm lost!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Who's gone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"I took Newton out for a walk and ended up going down this road I'd never "
"been on before..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"I was wandering around lost for a while, right? And then I realized Newton "
"was gone..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"I have such a horrible sense of direction... I should have stuck to places I"
" know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Where are you now?"
msgstr "Dove si trova in questo momento?"

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Uh... I have no clue..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Can you see any distinct buildings or structures nearby? Any landmarks?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Umm... Well, I'm in a narrow place that's crammed full of stuff..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "...Can you be more specific?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Not really, sorry... Please help me, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Wait right there."
msgstr "Fermi lì."

msgctxt "304"
msgid "(A narrow place crammed full of stuff?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "(I'll go check out a few spots like that and see if I can find her...)"
msgstr ""

